# Never commit the rulebook or any other Games Workshop material
docs/rulebook/
*.pdf

node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Compiled compendium packs ARE committed.
#
# The system is normally run by cloning this repo straight into
# Data/systems/kill-team-rpg, so the packs have to be present in the working
# tree. If they are missing, Foundry still registers each pack from
# system.json, then LevelDB silently creates an empty database in its place --
# the compendium opens and shows nothing, with no error.
#
# packs/_source/ holds the readable JSON and remains the thing to edit.
# Run `node tools/build-packs.mjs` after changing it, and commit both.
#
# LevelDB runtime files are not build output:
packs/*/LOCK
packs/*/LOG
packs/*/LOG.old
